window.docContents[37].resolve({"/The-sharp-sub-Coulomb-commutator/#commutator":{"contents":"For , the sharp commutator estimate combines the transport regularity  with the correction . The whole-space and periodic theorems allow real signed densities of mass one. The periodic specialization gives the sub-Coulomb commutator estimate in HRS.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Fluctuations of Riesz gases","header":"1. The sharp sub-Coulomb commutator","id":"/The-sharp-sub-Coulomb-commutator/#commutator"}});